 ## Editing a live sky
 
+The host applies `rtx.atmosphere.numos.nightSkyImage` to NUMOS's effective `nightSkyStars` setting
+at frame start. The existing Stars and Milky Way checkbox in Alt+X edits that same source choice.
+
 In the Alt+X developer menu, Game Setup → Step 2: Parameter Tuning → Sky Tuning uses the same `rtx.skyMode` option as the API.
 Enhanced adds six tabs and a built-in weather selector. Graphics Settings exposes the night, haze and
 cloud controls. These widgets set the live option layer used by `SetConfigVariable`. A later companion
